A [[mouth]]less [[Color|green]]-skinned [[alien]] '''species''' lived in [[the galaxy]]. The [[species]] was [[humanoid]] in form. Two black [[eye]]s were set in its face, along with a pronounced [[nose]].<ref name="Bibo" /> The species could be fed nutrients through a special suit.<ref name="Bibo guide">{{SW|url=news/buckets-list-extra-bibo-star-wars-resistance|text=Bucket's List Extra: 9 Fun Facts from "Bibo" - ''Star Wars Resistance''}}</ref>

During the [[Cold War]], one [[Unidentified mouthless alien|member]] lived aboard the ''[[Colossus]]'' on the [[planet]] [[Castilon]]<ref name="Bibo" /> and liked to rest at [[Aunt Z's Tavern]].<ref name="Doza">{{Resistance|The Doza Dilemma}}</ref> The alien later watched the descent of the station into the ocean in a corridor with [[Jooks]].<ref name="Descent">{{Resistance|Descent (episode)}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The species was created for the [[2018]] ''[[Star Wars]]'' animated series ''[[Star Wars Resistance]]'', where a member of the species appears in several background scenes. The art asset was designed by [[Aaron Pham]].<ref name="Bibo guide" />

